<description>&lt;p&gt;President De la Espriella faces renewed armed violence as Colombian military airstrikes killed five ELN rebels and a bombing hit a narcoterrorist site in Valle del Cauca. ELN activity has spread into Venezuela while thousands protested his tax plans and spending cuts across the country. The United States expanded military operations in Latin America, delivered a C-130 to Bogotá, and is being sued by Ecuadorian fishermen over a mysterious boat strike. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/world/americas/colombia-farc-peace-deal.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOLW1YMkRVZkFrRmpmZ2VLaUpMNVd1ajlFTTM5U1VMY1Q2WDlUQXFUeG9KNENUeDUyT0doZmUxSFlsZnM2WXhENkgtYndZNkc4Tk1xSUpoZFZPZlFidWcyb09KejAta0VHeFN2OEl6RXZjNHQ0NHM5QUZwancydEU2cmQtVU45ZjhQT2pvLXpzQjZpU0FSWE1sREw0NlhVS2xnT2dsRDUwNVlYZnE5?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQaVlsN2FuNE82VGp2ZXBmTF9Odkk0OU5waE5qUGdMZnRRNjRtQlVWaTg4encxV1NiMU9FTWh4TnVLc09DN1dLOWlRRHczUDBsWjEzdk9vdzY2N0VldVlXdTBSQXBha3pfb3RrMDE4LUctbHE4eWxxbXRLVktPM28wZlZrNWpQcVM1WHF0bEl4MXdpdTZONVBsUzkwMGxmRHFPNTBiaFQ1UDNKSjVkd2JqVlRqclkzUWVPX09qUGxn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNaXU2QWJ1OTVPMVVBc3JHT2hCYm9UOXVQSE5oRnZvUmtuOF9DNkN4bU42Tm9pSVRtNDduNDhQdFI0U1F4a29kVXdGVk1SOU93bmdveWhjWTBuTlI1TV9maUlIZDdHWVBIdTZpWGpKQkFIWndLRFFkVlRCVGxpVnhvaEVSQU14cnlwTkFGTi10akEyVnhoTC1xQXhhZzdDTlJiaUgwVFdfMEg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Justice For Colombia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPRXhMWmJMb1VhVkc2MnVGUkFQVXYzMFBsaHFHQXZSQjQxc2hKSFNtTWd1NUlBU2MwWEJTa0hSYkVJLUVaaDFMWTFmbk